{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/hwbqtkby","slideIndex":1,"layout":{"id":"ly/p83mt83u","name":"标题和内容"},"title":"一、项目简介","textShapes":2,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/9072xkry","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":88,"top":38.33,"width":1104,"height":139.17},"name":"Title 1","placeholder":"title","text":"一、项目简介","style":{"fontSize":58.67,"typeface":"黑体","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ozy1ofad","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":88,"top":191.67,"width":1104,"height":456.83},"name":"Content Placeholder 2","text":"目标：在不知道设备佩戴位置、无需 T-Pose 等初始化动作的前提下，实现即穿即用的动作捕捉。\n当前问题：使用合成数据训练的位置分类网络，在真机上的效果很差。\n本阶段目标：先验证真机数据能否解决手机和手表的身体位置分类。\n输入：手机、手表的朝向与加速度时序，以及两设备间的 UWB 距离。\n输出：手机和手表所在的身体槽位及分类置信度。\n数据路线：本人数据用于训练与验证，后续用其他人或其他设备的数据测试泛化。","style":{"fontSize":29.33,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#222222","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/hwbqtkby","slideIndex":1,"text":""}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/ofy9wn61","slideIndex":2,"layout":{"id":"ly/p83mt83u","name":"标题和内容"},"title":"二、上周工作和结论","textShapes":2,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/cza94vmx","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":52.8,"top":26.88,"width":1171.2,"height":59.52},"name":"TextBox 1","text":"二、上周工作和结论","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":53.33,"typeface":"黑体","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/d0jax03i","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":57.6,"top":110.4,"width":1161.6,"height":537.6},"name":"TextBox 2","text":"学长建议：合成集到真机的域差异过大，应先采一个小规模真机数据集训练位置分类网络。\n- 上周重点：确定自采数据的规模、动作种类、佩戴组合、标签和文件格式。\n- 已完成：写好训练数据采集脚本，固化标定、录制、传输、对齐和质量检查协议。\n- 已调整：只用 iPhone 标定 R_MI，Watch 不单独标定，直接共享手机的 R_MI。\n- 当前阻塞：iPhone 与 Watch 采集软件仍需学长更新，未按原计划采完全部数据。\n- 结论：采集方案和代码已基本就绪，下一步取决于采集 App 更新和真机数据落地。","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":29.33,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#222222","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ofy9wn61","slideIndex":2,"text":""}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/jyx0ra1s","slideIndex":3,"layout":{"id":"ly/p83mt83u","name":"标题和内容"},"title":"2.1  自采训练集规模","textShapes":2,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/1cj2d8b6","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":52.8,"top":26.88,"width":1171.2,"height":59.52},"name":"TextBox 1","text":"2.1  自采训练集规模","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":42.67,"typeface":"黑体","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/rm1k7yt4","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":48,"top":547.2,"width":1180.8,"height":124.8},"name":"TextBox 3","text":"每个动作覆盖 4 种佩戴、3 组重复和 2 种手机朝向。目录结构固定，可中断后继续采集。","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":26.67,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
