{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/jyx0ra1s","slideIndex":3,"text":""}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/i107q5of","slideIndex":4,"layout":{"id":"ly/p83mt83u","name":"标题和内容"},"title":"2.2  数据内容与标签格式","textShapes":2,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/dgbulwnm","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":52.8,"top":26.88,"width":1171.2,"height":59.52},"name":"TextBox 1","text":"2.2  数据内容与标签格式","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":42.67,"typeface":"黑体","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/cf2tcr61","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":57.6,"top":115.2,"width":1161.6,"height":528},"name":"TextBox 2","text":"- 原始文件：iPhone / Watch 的 device_motion、UWB 距离、设备时间戳和 session ID。\n- 槽位真值：Watch 为左腕或右腕，Phone 为左大腿或右大腿口袋。\n- 标定结果：iPhone 由 N-pose 和向前走得到 R_MI，Watch 直接使用同一个 R_MI。\n- 朝向序列：orientation = R_MI @ RIS，统一到模型坐标系。\n- 加速度序列：acceleration = R_MI @ RIS @ aS，单位为 m/s²。\n- 统一按 30 FPS 对齐并保存有效性掩码，UWB 从原始事件按时间戳对齐。","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":32,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#222222","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/i107q5of","slideIndex":4,"text":""}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/x8f69ofe","slideIndex":5,"layout":{"id":"ly/p83mt83u","name":"标题和内容"},"title":"2.3  采集与标定协议","textShapes":3,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/yhg7epsj","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":52.8,"top":26.88,"width":1171.2,"height":59.52},"name":"TextBox 1","text":"2.3  采集与标定协议","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":40,"typeface":"黑体","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/zi98nu94","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":57.6,"top":110.4,"width":1161.6,"height":124.8},"name":"TextBox 2","text":"核心约定：手机和手表全程本地记录；只在标定阶段让 iPhone 发送实时 UDP。","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":29.33,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/87ipkzal","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":57.6,"top":244.8,"width":1161.6,"height":345.6},"name":"TextBox 3","text":"- 两台设备开始同一条本地采集，电脑只等待 iPhone 的 device_motion。\n- N-pose 先检查静止稳定性，通过后再做向前走。\n- iPhone 向前走计算 R_MI；失败立即重做，不开始正式动作。\n- 标定通过后关闭手机 UDP，再录制 20 秒正式动作；Watch 始终不实时传输。\n- 结束后 Watch 整文件传到手机，电脑导入两份文件并再次校验标定窗口。","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":32,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#222222","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/x8f69ofe","slideIndex":5,"text":""}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/gnmp4jqx","slideIndex":6,"layout":{"id":"ly/p83mt83u","name":"标题和内容"},"title":"2.4  采集脚本与当前进度","textShapes":2,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/cb2tkvap","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":52.8,"top":26.88,"width":1171.2,"height":59.52},"name":"TextBox 1","text":"2.4  采集脚本与当前进度","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":42.67,"typeface":"黑体","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/dcbud0ra","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":57.6,"top":115.2,"width":1161.6,"height":528},"name":"TextBox 2","text":"- 自动生成 216 条计划，按动作、佩戴、重复组和手机朝向建立目录。\n- capture.json 记录动作标签、槽位真值、N-pose、向前走和正式动作窗口。\n- 自动识别 iPhone / Watch 文件，完成 30 FPS 对齐并输出 labels、meta 和 quality。\n- 已验证：N-pose 失败会立即停止；Watch 与 iPhone 使用完全相同的 R_MI。\n- 已验证：模型坐标系朝向、加速度和槽位真值可以正常保存与回读。\n- 尚未完成：采集 App 更新前无法稳定跑完整训练集，真实样本数量仍不足。","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":32,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#222222","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/gnmp4jqx","slideIndex":6,"text":""}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/fu1gfa1s","slideIndex":7,"layout":{"id":"ly/p83mt83u","name":"标题和内容"},"title":"三、下周计划","textShapes":3,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/18byd4zy","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":52.8,"top":26.88,"width":1171.2,"height":59.52},"name":"TextBox 1","text":"三、下周计划","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":53.33,"typeface":"黑体","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/g72x4zyd","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":57.6,"top":115.2,"width":1161.6,"height":307.2},"name":"TextBox 2","text":"- 1. 等采集 App 更新后，优先完成 216 条本人训练数据，并同步检查文件完整性和标定质量。\n- 2. 用自采真机数据训练位置分类网络，在留出的验证集上检查可行性和 UWB 的实际增益。\n- 3. 有余力时，用其他参与者或其他设备的数据测试泛化能力。","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":32,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#222222","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ri9g7uhw","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":57.6,"top":436.8,"width":1161.6,"height":211.2},"name":"TextBox 3","text":"判断标准：真机训练后，验证集应明显改善手机口袋位置分类；独立测试集用于判断模型能否跨人、跨设备泛化。","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#222222","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/fu1gfa1s","slideIndex":7,"text":""}